// Detection: Password spray
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1110.003 - Brute Force: Password Spraying
//
// Groups failed-credential sign-ins (ResultType 50126 = invalid username or
// password) by source IP, and flags any single source that failed against
// three or more distinct accounts in the window. Many distinct accounts from
// one source is the signature that separates a spray from ordinary user error.
//
// Tune: raise the TargetedAccounts threshold in larger tenants; shorten the
// window for higher-fidelity alerting; add a follow-on query correlating a
// SUCCESS (ResultType 0) from the same IP to catch a spray that landed.

SigninLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| where ResultType == 50126
| summarize
    FailedAttempts = count(),
    TargetedAccounts = dcount(UserPrincipalName),
    Accounts = make_set(UserPrincipalName),
    FirstSeen = min(TimeGenerated),
    LastSeen = max(TimeGenerated)
    by IPAddress
| where TargetedAccounts >= 3
| sort by TargetedAccounts desc
